.doc Memo about the new filing system
.fontmarkers short
.h1 Memo
To: All staff

From: The records office

Date: 12 November 2026

Subject: The new filing system

.h2 What changes
From the first of December every document is kept in one place, the shared
directory named {c:records}, and no longer in the private directories of the
people who wrote them.  Each document has a short name that begins with its
year, such as {c:2026-budget}, so that the directory sorts itself.

.h2 What to do
- Move the documents that you still use into the new directory.
- Give each one a name that begins with the year.
- Remove the old copies when you have checked the new ones.

.h2 Questions
Ask the records office.  We will answer within one working day.
